At the time when I first came to your house, at that time I gave you supreme divine knowledge,
but when I saw that your mind was entangled in material things, then I gave you
only one son who became the cause of your joy and sorrow. Now, the sons experience the heat. And the house of Dara, with various riches and wealth. 21. Shabdadayascha vishayaschalaa rajyavibhutayah. The king, the strength, the treasury, the servants, the ministers, and the well-wishers. 22. All the brave men are saddened by the fear of death. The famous Gandharvanagar, the dreams and desires. 23 ज़a. Meaning of the word

